---
<!-- 8. OUR PEOPLE / TEAM (Studio Discipline Leads) -->
<section class="w-full py-16 sm:py-24 bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 sm:gap-8 items-end mb-10 sm:mb-16">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <span class="font-label text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.24em] text-primary uppercase mb-2 sm:mb-3 block">THE TEAM BEHIND THE PROJECT</span>
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-[42px] font-bold text-on-surface tracking-tight leading-tight">
          PEOPLE, EXPERTISE AND COORDINATION.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Our multi-disciplinary team brings together registered architects, certified structural engineers, interior designers, and veteran site superintendents under one operational roof.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Large Photography of On-Site Engineering Collaboration -->
    <div class="w-full aspect-[16/9] sm:aspect-[21/9] rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg mb-10 sm:mb-16 relative group">
      <div class="w-full h-full bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" style="background-image: url('https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDNqJgzwV2ysE7dT-Afc9DiJeXehIwFfZypOpYaEzaIw9a5SXo8N2XK7BMUjir_AlaAkp-6OhuAoY4zdRVuFW3_-JRKbDvAWGw89935PuBmbsWYnl7gpoFJfMRHew4zGK587LyRF0l2w0W6R2VsgKyUPNwonnuW7W9W5sgG2zpB4kzsnHdARiW9AH8WIBc5fklTRZgDCMHQAsT0H8xWNpiJ6ISg9dxlazuNBL34G6O2B2zzy0unKkVv3Q')"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-inverse-surface/80 via-transparent to-transparent flex items-end p-4 sm:p-8">
        <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-on-primary font-medium tracking-wide">
          On-site quality audit and architectural synchronization — Metropolis Tower, Paanya Execution Squad.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- 4 Discipline Leads Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors">
        <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-primary tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">ARCHITECTURAL DIRECTION</span>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2">Spatial Choreography</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Master-planning, volumetric flow, passive natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor sightlines.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/30 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold text-outline uppercase tracking-wider">
          <span>Principal Lead</span>
          <span class="text-primary font-bold">16 Yrs Exp</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors">
        <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-primary tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">STRUCTURAL SYSTEMS</span>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2">Chief Engineering</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Deep foundation stability, seismic-resilient frames, post-tensioned slabs, and cantilever engineering.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/30 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold text-outline uppercase tracking-wider">
          <span>Engineering Lead</span>
          <span class="text-primary font-bold">22 Yrs Exp</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors">
        <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-primary tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">OPERATIONS &amp; LOGISTICS</span>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2">Project Director</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Critical path tracking, supply chain integrity, multi-trade scheduling, and zero-compromise timeline delivery.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/30 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold text-outline uppercase tracking-wider">
          <span>Turnkey Delivery</span>
          <span class="text-primary font-bold">19 Yrs Exp</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors">
        <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-primary tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">INTERIORS &amp; CRAFT</span>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-2">Bespoke Finishes</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Custom millwork coordination, rare Italian natural stone sourcing, micro-lighting detailing, and acoustic comfort.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/30 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold text-outline uppercase tracking-wider">
          <span>Interior Studio Head</span>
          <span class="text-primary font-bold">14 Yrs Exp</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
